# Bytecode the python suites in this corpus produce.
#
# This file is for the LIVE install, where this directory is its OWN git repository
# (scripts/init-test-repos.sh) and the monorepo root .gitignore does not reach it. The
# recovery snapshot screens `git status --porcelain --untracked-files=all` per repo and
# refuses the whole run on an untracked __pycache__ — which is exactly what the live
# install carries today, from the pytest-form modules here that import a shared helper.
#
# Monorepo-wide rules stay in the root .gitignore — this is a shipped per-repo artifact,
# not a second place to add them.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
